  "definition": "A production environment surrounded by curved LED walls and floors displaying real-time computer-generated imagery, enabling in-camera visual effects (ICVFX) for film, television, and broadcast production. Digital backgrounds rendered by a game engine react dynamically to tracked camera movement, capturing realistic lighting and reflections directly on-sensor. Epic Games' StageCraft system and Unreal Engine power the majority of commercial installations, with facilities now exceeding 1,700 m\u00b2 of LED surface area.",
